Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: track bridge flow lifecycle and hardware activity

Track bridge flow context by PPE slot, namespace, bridge, VLAN, ports
and MAC pair. Retire direct fallback bindings when their path changes;
ordinary TC entries retain their existing parent teardown ownership.
Report bound source activity to bridge aging for both paths. Same-port
FDB ADD keeps a valid path; DEL and MAC moves retire it. Validate the
generation under ppe_lock and publish tracking at one shared exit,
including cleanup of partially committed direct fallback entries.

This file was generated entirely by AI.
It has not been reviewed line by line by a human.

